OL,4,G1600FMargherita Taylor
OL,5,     GJoin Margherita as she plays the
OL,6,     Gbest music to take you into the
OL,7,     Gevening, including a film
OL,8,     Gfavourite at 4.30pm and a
OL,9,     Grecording by her Star in the
OL,10,     GSpotlight at 6pm.
OL,11,G1900FClassic FM at the Movies
OL,12,     GJonathan Ross, award-winning
OL,13,     Gpresenter and film critic,
OL,14,     Gpresents the greatest music from
OL,15,     Gthe silver screen.
OL,16,G2100FClassical Love Themes with Dawn
OL,17,     GThroughout February, Dawn dives
OL,18,     Ginto classical music's greatest
OL,19,     Glove stories, sharing iconic
OL,20,     Gpieces that capture every swoon,
OL,21,     Gspark and heartfelt moment along
OL,22,     Gthe way.
